#: src/logging/class-logginghelp.php:51
msgid "The Reset button clears filters and returns to the latest entries."
msgstr "Met de knop Reset worden de filters gewist en keert u terug naar de meest recente vermeldingen."

#: src/logging/class-logginghelp.php:58
msgid "Export and Retention"
msgstr "Export en behoud"

#: src/logging/class-logginghelp.php:60
